        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: వ్యాధి",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వ్యాధి — vyādhi — \"a disorder; a disease\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ వ్యాధికి ఇంకా మందు లేదు. ā vyādhiki iṅkā mandu lēdu. There is still no cure for that disease."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "More formal than రోగం or జబ్బు; doctors and the news say వ్యాధి (vyādhi)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వ్యాధి (vyādhi) is borrowed from Sanskrit vyādhi, \"disease\" (CDIAL 12202)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
