              "text": "అంటువ్యాధి (aṇṭuvyādhi) joins native aṇṭu, \"to touch; contact, defilement by touch\" (DEDR 120), to Sanskrit vyādhi, \"disease\" (CDIAL 12202)."
            }
          ]
        },
